{"bookId":"HAB","bookName":"Habacuc","shortName":"Hab","version":"RVR1909","chaptersCount":3,"chapters":{"1":[{"bookId":"HAB","chapter":1,"verse":1,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"La profecía que vio el profeta Habacuc.","strongTokens":[{"word":"profecía","strong":"4853"},{"word":"que","strong":"834"},{"word":"vio","strong":"2372"},{"word":"profeta","strong":"5030"},{"word":"Habacuc","strong":"2265"}]},{"bookId":"HAB","chapter":1,"verse":2,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"¿Hasta cuándo, oh Jehová, clamaré, y no oirás; y daré voces a ti a causa de la violencia, y no salvarás?","strongTokens":[{"word":"Hasta","strong":"5704"},{"word":"cuándo","strong":"575"},{"word":"Jehová","strong":"3068"},{"word":"clamaré","strong":"7768"},{"word":"no","strong":"3808"},{"word":"no","strong":"3467"},{"word":"oirás","strong":"8085"},{"word":"voces","strong":"2199"},{"word":"a","strong":"413"},{"word":"y","strong":"2555"},{"word":"salvarás","strong":"3808"}]},{"bookId":"HAB","chapter":1,"verse":3,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"¿Por qué me haces ver iniquidad, y haces que vea molestia? Destrucción y violencia están delante de mí, y pleito y contienda se levantan.","strongTokens":[{"word":"qué","strong":"4100"},{"word":"ver","strong":"7200"},{"word":"iniquidad","strong":"205"},{"word":"vea","strong":"5027"},{"word":"molestia","strong":"5999"},{"word":"Destrucción","strong":"7701"},{"word":"violencia","strong":"2555"},{"word":"delante","strong":"5048"},{"word":"y","strong":"1961"},{"word":"pleito","strong":"7379"},{"word":"contienda","strong":"4066"},{"word":"levantan","strong":"5375"}]},{"bookId":"HAB","chapter":1,"verse":4,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Por lo cual la ley es debilitada, y el juicio no sale según la verdad; por cuanto el impío asedia al justo, por eso sale torcida la justicia.","strongTokens":[{"word":"Por","strong":"5921"},{"word":"cual","strong":"3651"},{"word":"cual","strong":"6313"},{"word":"ley","strong":"8451"},{"word":"debilitada","strong":"6291"},{"word":"juicio","strong":"4941"},{"word":"juicio","strong":"5331"},{"word":"no","strong":"3808"},{"word":"sale","strong":"3318"},{"word":"cuanto","strong":"3588"},{"word":"asedia","strong":"7563"},{"word":"asedia","strong":"3803"},{"word":"por","strong":"6662"},{"word":"eso","strong":"5921"},{"word":"sale","strong":"3651"},{"word":"torcida","strong":"3318"},{"word":"la","strong":"6127"}]},{"bookId":"HAB","chapter":1,"verse":5,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Mirad entre las naciones, y ved, y asombraos; porque haré una obra en vuestros días, que aun cuando se os contare, no la creeréis.","strongTokens":[{"word":"Mirad","strong":"7200"},{"word":"naciones","strong":"1471"},{"word":"ved","strong":"5027"},{"word":"asombraos","strong":"8539"},{"word":"porque","strong":"3588"},{"word":"haré","strong":"6467"},{"word":"obra","strong":"6466"},{"word":"días","strong":"3117"},{"word":"cuando","strong":"3588"},{"word":"contare","strong":"5608"},{"word":"no","strong":"3808"},{"word":"creeréis","strong":"539"}]},{"bookId":"HAB","chapter":1,"verse":6,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Porque he aquí, yo levanto a los caldeos, nación cruel y presurosa, que camina por la anchura de la tierra para poseer las moradas ajenas.,","strongTokens":[{"word":"Porque","strong":"3588"},{"word":"Porque","strong":"2005"},{"word":"Porque","strong":"6965"},{"word":"caldeos","strong":"3778"},{"word":"caldeos","strong":"1471"},{"word":"caldeos","strong":"4751"},{"word":"presurosa","strong":"4116"},{"word":"camina","strong":"1980"},{"word":"anchura","strong":"4800"},{"word":"tierra","strong":"776"},{"word":"poseer","strong":"3423"},{"word":"poseer","strong":"4908"},{"word":"ajenas","strong":"3808"}]},{"bookId":"HAB","chapter":1,"verse":7,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Formidable es y terrible; de ella misma procede su justicia y su dignidad.","strongTokens":[{"word":"Formidable","strong":"366"},{"word":"terrible","strong":"3372"},{"word":"de","strong":"4480"},{"word":"ella","strong":"1931"},{"word":"misma","strong":"1931"},{"word":"procede","strong":"3318"},{"word":"su","strong":"1931"},{"word":"justicia","strong":"4941"},{"word":"su","strong":"1931"},{"word":"dignidad","strong":"7613"}]},{"bookId":"HAB","chapter":1,"verse":8,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Sus caballos serán más ligeros que leopardos, y más feroces que lobos nocturnos, y sus jinetes se multiplicarán; vendrán de lejos sus jinetes, y volarán como águilas que se apresuran a devorar.","strongTokens":[{"word":"caballos","strong":"5483"},{"word":"ligeros","strong":"7043"},{"word":"leopardos","strong":"5246"},{"word":"feroces","strong":"2300"},{"word":"lobos","strong":"2061"},{"word":"nocturnos","strong":"6153"},{"word":"nocturnos","strong":"6335"},{"word":"jinetes","strong":"6571"},{"word":"multiplicarán","strong":"6580"},{"word":"lejos","strong":"7350"},{"word":"lejos","strong":"935"},{"word":"lejos","strong":"5774"},{"word":"jinetes","strong":"6571"},{"word":"águilas","strong":"5404"},{"word":"águilas","strong":"2363"},{"word":"devorar","strong":"398"}]},{"bookId":"HAB","chapter":1,"verse":9,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Toda ella vendrá a la presa; el terror va delante de ella, y recogerá cautivos como arena.","strongTokens":[{"word":"Toda","strong":"3605"},{"word":"presa","strong":"2555"},{"word":"presa","strong":"935"},{"word":"presa","strong":"4041"},{"word":"presa","strong":"6440"},{"word":"ella","strong":"6921"},{"word":"recogerá","strong":"622"},{"word":"cautivos","strong":"7628"},{"word":"arena","strong":"2344"}]},{"bookId":"HAB","chapter":1,"verse":10,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Escarnecerá a los reyes, y de los príncipes hará burla; se reirá de toda fortaleza, y levantará terraplén y la tomará.","strongTokens":[{"word":"Escarnecerá","strong":"7046"},{"word":"reyes","strong":"4428"},{"word":"príncipes","strong":"7336"},{"word":"burla","strong":"4890"},{"word":"burla","strong":"1931"},{"word":"burla","strong":"1931"},{"word":"reirá","strong":"7832"},{"word":"toda","strong":"3605"},{"word":"fortaleza","strong":"4013"},{"word":"levantará","strong":"6651"},{"word":"terraplén","strong":"6083"},{"word":"la","strong":"1931"},{"word":"tomará","strong":"3920"}]},{"bookId":"HAB","chapter":1,"verse":11,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Luego pasará como el huracán, y ofenderá atribuyendo su fuerza a su dios.","strongTokens":[{"word":"Luego","strong":"227"},{"word":"pasará","strong":"2498"},{"word":"huracán","strong":"7307"},{"word":"ofenderá","strong":"5674"},{"word":"atribuyendo","strong":"816"},{"word":"atribuyendo","strong":"2098"},{"word":"fuerza","strong":"3581"},{"word":"fuerza","strong":"430"}]},{"bookId":"HAB","chapter":1,"verse":12,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"¿No eres tú desde el principio, oh Jehová, Dios mío, Santo mío? No moriremos. Oh Jehová, para juicio lo pusiste; y tú, oh Roca, lo fundaste para castigar.","strongTokens":[{"word":"No","strong":"3808"},{"word":"tú","strong":"859"},{"word":"principio","strong":"6924"},{"word":"Jehová","strong":"3069"},{"word":"Jehová","strong":"430"},{"word":"Santo","strong":"6918"},{"word":"No","strong":"3808"},{"word":"No","strong":"4191"},{"word":"moriremos","strong":"4962"},{"word":"Jehová","strong":"3069"},{"word":"juicio","strong":"4941"},{"word":"juicio","strong":"7760"},{"word":"Roca","strong":"6697"},{"word":"fundaste","strong":"3245"},{"word":"castigar","strong":"3198"}]},{"bookId":"HAB","chapter":1,"verse":13,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Muy limpio eres de ojos para ver el mal, ni puedes ver el agravio; ¿por qué ves a los menospreciadores, y callas cuando destruye el impío al más justo que él,","strongTokens":[{"word":"eres","strong":"2890"},{"word":"para","strong":"5869"},{"word":"ver","strong":"4480"},{"word":"el","strong":"7200"},{"word":"mal","strong":"7451"},{"word":"puedes","strong":"3808"},{"word":"ver","strong":"3201"},{"word":"el","strong":"5027"},{"word":"agravio","strong":"413"},{"word":"por","strong":"5999"},{"word":"ves","strong":"4100"},{"word":"a","strong":"5027"},{"word":"y","strong":"898"},{"word":"cuando","strong":"2790"},{"word":"el","strong":"1104"},{"word":"al","strong":"7563"},{"word":"que","strong":"6662"},{"word":"él","strong":"4480"}]},{"bookId":"HAB","chapter":1,"verse":14,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"y haces que sean los hombres como los peces del mar, como reptiles que no tienen quien los gobierne?","strongTokens":[{"word":"haces","strong":"6213"},{"word":"como","strong":"120"},{"word":"del","strong":"1709"},{"word":"como","strong":"3220"},{"word":"que","strong":"7431"},{"word":"tienen","strong":"3808"},{"word":"tienen","strong":"4910"}]},{"bookId":"HAB","chapter":1,"verse":15,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Sacará a todos con anzuelo, los recogerá con su red, y los juntará en sus mallas; por lo cual se alegrará y se regocijará.","strongTokens":[{"word":"Sacará","strong":"5927"},{"word":"todos","strong":"3605"},{"word":"todos","strong":"2443"},{"word":"anzuelo","strong":"2441"},{"word":"recogerá","strong":"1641"},{"word":"red","strong":"2764"},{"word":"juntará","strong":"622"},{"word":"juntará","strong":"4365"},{"word":"mallas","strong":"4364"},{"word":"por","strong":"5921"},{"word":"cual","strong":"3651"},{"word":"alegrará","strong":"8055"},{"word":"alegrará","strong":"1523"}]},{"bookId":"HAB","chapter":1,"verse":16,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Por esto hará sacrificios a su red, y ofrecerá sahumerios a sus mallas; porque con ellas engordó su porción, y engrasó su comida.","strongTokens":[{"word":"Por","strong":"5921"},{"word":"esto","strong":"3651"},{"word":"sacrificios","strong":"2076"},{"word":"red","strong":"2764"},{"word":"sahumerios","strong":"6999"},{"word":"sahumerios","strong":"4365"},{"word":"mallas","strong":"4364"},{"word":"porque","strong":"3588"},{"word":"ellas","strong":"1992"},{"word":"engordó","strong":"8082"},{"word":"engordó","strong":"2506"},{"word":"engrasó","strong":"1277"},{"word":"comida","strong":"3978"}]},{"bookId":"HAB","chapter":1,"verse":17,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"¿Vaciará por eso su red, y no tendrá piedad de aniquilar naciones continuamente?","strongTokens":[{"word":"por","strong":"5921"},{"word":"eso","strong":"3651"},{"word":"eso","strong":"7324"},{"word":"red","strong":"2764"},{"word":"no","strong":"3808"},{"word":"piedad","strong":"2550"},{"word":"aniquilar","strong":"2026"},{"word":"naciones","strong":"1471"},{"word":"continuamente","strong":"8548"}]}],"2":[{"bookId":"HAB","chapter":2,"verse":1,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Sobre mi guarda estaré, y sobre la fortaleza afirmaré el pie, y velaré para ver lo que se me dirá, y qué he de responder tocante a mi queja.","strongTokens":[{"word":"Sobre","strong":"5921"},{"word":"guarda","strong":"4931"},{"word":"estaré","strong":"5975"},{"word":"sobre","strong":"5921"},{"word":"fortaleza","strong":"4692"},{"word":"afirmaré","strong":"3320"},{"word":"velaré","strong":"6822"},{"word":"ver","strong":"7200"},{"word":"que","strong":"4100"},{"word":"que","strong":"7725"},{"word":"dirá","strong":"1696"},{"word":"qué","strong":"4100"},{"word":"a","strong":"5921"},{"word":"queja","strong":"8433"}]},{"bookId":"HAB","chapter":2,"verse":2,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Y Jehová me respondió, y dijo: Escribe la visión, y declárala en tablas, para que corra el que leyere en ella.","strongTokens":[{"word":"Jehová","strong":"3068"},{"word":"respondió","strong":"6030"},{"word":"dijo","strong":"559"},{"word":"Escribe","strong":"3789"},{"word":"visión","strong":"2377"},{"word":"declárala","strong":"874"},{"word":"en","strong":"5921"},{"word":"tablas","strong":"3871"},{"word":"tablas","strong":"4616"},{"word":"tablas","strong":"7323"},{"word":"corra","strong":"7518"},{"word":"leyere","strong":"7121"}]},{"bookId":"HAB","chapter":2,"verse":3,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Aunque la visión tardará aún por un tiempo, mas se apresura hacia el fin, y no mentirá; aunque tardare, espéralo,, porque sin duda vendrá, no tardará.","strongTokens":[{"word":"Aunque","strong":"3588"},{"word":"visión","strong":"2377"},{"word":"aún","strong":"5750"},{"word":"tiempo","strong":"4150"},{"word":"tiempo","strong":"6315"},{"word":"apresura","strong":"6341"},{"word":"fin","strong":"7093"},{"word":"no","strong":"3808"},{"word":"mentirá","strong":"3576"},{"word":"aunque","strong":"518"},{"word":"aunque","strong":"4102"},{"word":"espéralo","strong":"2442"},{"word":"porque","strong":"3588"},{"word":"porque","strong":"935"},{"word":"porque","strong":"935"},{"word":"no","strong":"3808"},{"word":"tardará","strong":"309"}]},{"bookId":"HAB","chapter":2,"verse":4,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"He aquí que aquel cuya alma no es recta, se enorgullece; mas el justo por su fe vivirá.","strongTokens":[{"word":"que","strong":"2009"},{"word":"no","strong":"5315"},{"word":"es","strong":"3808"},{"word":"recta","strong":"3474"},{"word":"mas","strong":"6075"},{"word":"por","strong":"6662"},{"word":"vivirá","strong":"530"},{"word":"vivirá","strong":"2421"}]},{"bookId":"HAB","chapter":2,"verse":5,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Y también, el que es dado al vino es traicionero, hombre soberbio, que no permanecerá; ensanchó como el Seol su alma, y es como la muerte, que no se saciará; antes reunió para sí todas las gentes, y juntó para sí todos los pueblos.","strongTokens":[{"word":"también","strong":"637"},{"word":"que","strong":"3588"},{"word":"vino","strong":"3196"},{"word":"traicionero","strong":"898"},{"word":"hombre","strong":"1397"},{"word":"soberbio","strong":"3093"},{"word":"no","strong":"3808"},{"word":"permanecerá","strong":"5115"},{"word":"permanecerá","strong":"834"},{"word":"ensanchó","strong":"7337"},{"word":"Seol","strong":"7585"},{"word":"su","strong":"1931"},{"word":"alma","strong":"5315"},{"word":"es","strong":"1931"},{"word":"muerte","strong":"4194"},{"word":"no","strong":"3808"},{"word":"saciará","strong":"7646"},{"word":"reunió","strong":"622"},{"word":"para","strong":"413"},{"word":"sí","strong":"1931"},{"word":"todas","strong":"3605"},{"word":"gentes","strong":"1471"},{"word":"juntó","strong":"6908"},{"word":"para","strong":"413"},{"word":"sí","strong":"1931"},{"word":"todos","strong":"3605"},{"word":"pueblos","strong":"5971"}]},{"bookId":"HAB","chapter":2,"verse":6,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"¿No han de levantar todos, éstos refrán sobre él, y sarcasmos contra él? Dirán: ¡Ay del que multiplicó lo que no era suyo! ¿Hasta cuándo había de acumular sobre sí prenda tras prenda?","strongTokens":[{"word":"No","strong":"3808"},{"word":"levantar","strong":"5375"},{"word":"todos","strong":"3605"},{"word":"éstos","strong":"428"},{"word":"refrán","strong":"4912"},{"word":"sobre","strong":"5921"},{"word":"y","strong":"4426"},{"word":"sarcasmos","strong":"2420"},{"word":"Dirán","strong":"559"},{"word":"Ay","strong":"1945"},{"word":"multiplicó","strong":"7235"},{"word":"no","strong":"3808"},{"word":"Hasta","strong":"5704"},{"word":"cuándo","strong":"4970"},{"word":"acumular","strong":"3513"},{"word":"sobre","strong":"5921"},{"word":"prenda","strong":"5671"}]},{"bookId":"HAB","chapter":2,"verse":7,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"¿No se levantarán de repente tus deudores, y se despertarán los que te harán temblar, y serás despojo para ellos?","strongTokens":[{"word":"No","strong":"3808"},{"word":"repente","strong":"6621"},{"word":"repente","strong":"6965"},{"word":"deudores","strong":"5391"},{"word":"deudores","strong":"6974"},{"word":"deudores","strong":"2111"},{"word":"despertarán","strong":"3364"},{"word":"serás","strong":"1961"},{"word":"despojo","strong":"4933"}]},{"bookId":"HAB","chapter":2,"verse":8,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Por cuanto tú has despojado a muchas naciones, todos los otros pueblos te despojarán, a causa de la sangre de los hombres, y de los robos de la tierra, de las ciudades y de todos los que habitan en ellas.","strongTokens":[{"word":"Por","strong":"3588"},{"word":"tú","strong":"859"},{"word":"despojado","strong":"7997"},{"word":"muchas","strong":"7227"},{"word":"naciones","strong":"1471"},{"word":"todos","strong":"3605"},{"word":"otros","strong":"3499"},{"word":"pueblos","strong":"5971"},{"word":"te","strong":"859"},{"word":"despojarán","strong":"7997"},{"word":"sangre","strong":"1818"},{"word":"hombres","strong":"120"},{"word":"robos","strong":"2555"},{"word":"tierra","strong":"776"},{"word":"ciudades","strong":"7151"},{"word":"todos","strong":"3605"},{"word":"habitan","strong":"3427"}]},{"bookId":"HAB","chapter":2,"verse":9,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"¡Ay del que codicia injusta ganancia para su casa, para poner en alto su nido, para escaparse del poder del mal!","strongTokens":[{"word":"Ay","strong":"1945"},{"word":"codicia","strong":"1215"},{"word":"injusta","strong":"7451"},{"word":"ganancia","strong":"1214"},{"word":"casa","strong":"1004"},{"word":"casa","strong":"7760"},{"word":"alto","strong":"4791"},{"word":"nido","strong":"7064"},{"word":"escaparse","strong":"5337"},{"word":"poder","strong":"3709"},{"word":"mal","strong":"7451"}]},{"bookId":"HAB","chapter":2,"verse":10,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Tomaste consejo vergonzoso para tu casa, asolaste muchos pueblos, y has pecado contra tu vida.","strongTokens":[{"word":"vergonzoso","strong":"3289"},{"word":"para","strong":"1322"},{"word":"asolaste","strong":"1004"},{"word":"muchos","strong":"7096"},{"word":"pueblos","strong":"7227"},{"word":"y","strong":"5971"},{"word":"contra","strong":"2398"},{"word":"contra","strong":"5315"}]},{"bookId":"HAB","chapter":2,"verse":11,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Porque la piedra clamará desde el muro, y la tabla del enmaderado le responderá.","strongTokens":[{"word":"Porque","strong":"3588"},{"word":"piedra","strong":"68"},{"word":"clamará","strong":"2199"},{"word":"muro","strong":"7023"},{"word":"tabla","strong":"3714"},{"word":"enmaderado","strong":"6086"},{"word":"responderá","strong":"6030"}]},{"bookId":"HAB","chapter":2,"verse":12,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"¡Ay del que edifica la ciudad con sangre, y del que funda una ciudad con iniquidad!","strongTokens":[{"word":"Ay","strong":"1945"},{"word":"edifica","strong":"1129"},{"word":"ciudad","strong":"5892"},{"word":"sangre","strong":"1818"},{"word":"sangre","strong":"3559"},{"word":"ciudad","strong":"7151"},{"word":"iniquidad","strong":"5766"}]},{"bookId":"HAB","chapter":2,"verse":13,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"¿No es esto de Jehová de los ejércitos? Los pueblos, pues, trabajarán para el fuego, y las naciones se fatigarán en vano.","strongTokens":[{"word":"No","strong":"3808"},{"word":"esto","strong":"2009"},{"word":"de","strong":"853"},{"word":"Jehová","strong":"3068"},{"word":"ejércitos","strong":"6635"},{"word":"pueblos","strong":"5971"},{"word":"trabajarán","strong":"3021"},{"word":"el","strong":"1767"},{"word":"fuego","strong":"784"},{"word":"naciones","strong":"3816"},{"word":"fatigarán","strong":"3286"},{"word":"en","strong":"1767"},{"word":"vano","strong":"7385"}]},{"bookId":"HAB","chapter":2,"verse":14,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Porque la tierra será llena del conocimiento de la gloria de Jehová, como las aguas cubren el mar.","strongTokens":[{"word":"Porque","strong":"3588"},{"word":"tierra","strong":"776"},{"word":"llena","strong":"4390"},{"word":"conocimiento","strong":"3045"},{"word":"gloria","strong":"3519"},{"word":"Jehová","strong":"3068"},{"word":"aguas","strong":"4325"},{"word":"cubren","strong":"3680"},{"word":"el","strong":"5921"},{"word":"mar","strong":"3220"}]},{"bookId":"HAB","chapter":2,"verse":15,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"¡Ay del que da de beber a su prójimo! ¡Ay de ti, que le acercas tu hiel, y le embriagas para mirar su desnudez!","strongTokens":[{"word":"Ay","strong":"1945"},{"word":"a","strong":"8248"},{"word":"Ay","strong":"7453"},{"word":"y","strong":"5596"},{"word":"y","strong":"2573"},{"word":"para","strong":"637"},{"word":"mirar","strong":"7937"},{"word":"mirar","strong":"4616"},{"word":"desnudez","strong":"5027"},{"word":"desnudez","strong":"5921"},{"word":"desnudez","strong":"4589"}]},{"bookId":"HAB","chapter":2,"verse":16,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Te has llenado de deshonra más que de honra; bebe tú también, y serás descubierto; el cáliz de la mano derecha de Jehová vendrá hasta ti, y vómito de afrenta sobre tu gloria.","strongTokens":[{"word":"de","strong":"7646"},{"word":"más","strong":"7036"},{"word":"bebe","strong":"3519"},{"word":"tú","strong":"8354"},{"word":"también","strong":"859"},{"word":"y","strong":"1571"},{"word":"el","strong":"6188"},{"word":"de","strong":"3563"},{"word":"Jehová","strong":"3225"},{"word":"hasta","strong":"3068"},{"word":"ti","strong":"5437"},{"word":"y","strong":"5921"},{"word":"vómito","strong":"859"},{"word":"afrenta","strong":"7022"},{"word":"gloria","strong":"5921"}]},{"bookId":"HAB","chapter":2,"verse":17,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Porque la rapiña del Líbano caerá sobre ti, y la destrucción de las fieras te quebrantará, a causa de la sangre de los hombres, y del robo de la tierra, de las ciudades y de todos los que en ellas habitaban.","strongTokens":[{"word":"Porque","strong":"3588"},{"word":"rapiña","strong":"2555"},{"word":"Líbano","strong":"3844"},{"word":"caerá","strong":"3680"},{"word":"destrucción","strong":"7701"},{"word":"fieras","strong":"929"},{"word":"quebrantará","strong":"2865"},{"word":"sangre","strong":"1818"},{"word":"hombres","strong":"120"},{"word":"robo","strong":"2555"},{"word":"tierra","strong":"776"},{"word":"ciudades","strong":"7151"},{"word":"todos","strong":"3605"},{"word":"habitaban","strong":"3427"}]},{"bookId":"HAB","chapter":2,"verse":18,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"¿De qué sirve la escultura que esculpió, el que la hizo? ¿la estatua de fundición que enseña mentira, para que haciendo imágenes mudas confíe el hacedor en su obra?","strongTokens":[{"word":"sirve","strong":"4100"},{"word":"la","strong":"3276"},{"word":"que","strong":"6459"},{"word":"esculpió","strong":"3588"},{"word":"el","strong":"6458"},{"word":"el","strong":"3336"},{"word":"la","strong":"3335"},{"word":"de","strong":"4541"},{"word":"de","strong":"3384"},{"word":"para","strong":"8267"},{"word":"que","strong":"3588"},{"word":"que","strong":"5921"},{"word":"que","strong":"6213"},{"word":"mudas","strong":"457"},{"word":"confíe","strong":"483"},{"word":"el","strong":"982"},{"word":"en","strong":"3335"}]},{"bookId":"HAB","chapter":2,"verse":19,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"¡Ay del que dice al palo: Despiértate; y a la piedra muda: Levántate! ¿Podrá él enseñar? He aquí está cubierto de oro y plata, y no hay espíritu dentro de él.","strongTokens":[{"word":"Ay","strong":"1945"},{"word":"dice","strong":"559"},{"word":"palo","strong":"6086"},{"word":"palo","strong":"6974"},{"word":"palo","strong":"5782"},{"word":"piedra","strong":"68"},{"word":"muda","strong":"1748"},{"word":"él","strong":"1931"},{"word":"enseñar","strong":"3384"},{"word":"aquí","strong":"2009"},{"word":"aquí","strong":"1931"},{"word":"cubierto","strong":"8610"},{"word":"oro","strong":"2091"},{"word":"plata","strong":"3701"},{"word":"no","strong":"369"},{"word":"hay","strong":"3605"},{"word":"espíritu","strong":"7307"},{"word":"dentro","strong":"7130"},{"word":"él","strong":"1931"}]},{"bookId":"HAB","chapter":2,"verse":20,"version":"RVR1909"